          "title": "How to learn a language in a month?",
          "text": "Can you really learn a language in a month? Journalist Mark decided to try. He wanted to speak basic Spanish before a trip to Madrid. He promised himself to study two hours a day and refused to speak English with his Spanish friends. It wasn't easy to stay motivated, but he managed to have a twenty-minute conversation with a taxi driver on his first day in Madrid. 'I didn't learn to speak perfectly,' he says, 'but I learned not to be afraid.'",
